  "title": "Strawberry Spice Loaf",
  "description": "This is a wonderful holiday bread! Every time I take this bread to a holiday gathering, everyone wants the recipe. It&#39;s easy to make, very moist, and has lots of fresh strawberry flavor. Try it, you&#39;ll be glad you did.",
